   Massaglia, S.; Peano, C.; Gregis, A.; Ghisalberti, C., Univ Turin, UNESCO Chair Sustainable Dev \& Terr Management, I-10100 Turin, Italy.
   Sottile, F., Univ Palermo, Dept Architecture, Viale Sci,Ed 14, I-90128 Palermo, Italy.},
